frontlet_data:alpes_Person_168 a frontlet:Person ;
    frontlet:composedOf frontlet_data:alpes_Death_gen_168 ;
    frontlet:gender thes:male ;
    frontlet:hasComment """Message received from Marijana via mail (31.03.2022):
Facebook message: "It is with great sadness and sorrow that we received the news of the death of the young Boy tayyab Waraich has been drowned in Crotia 2-03-2021 border near road number 6 from varno gran he was going to Italy but accidentally he was drowned by crossed the river in Crotia so we have request to all agencies and specially government of Crotia and still his family and his relative and his relatives living in camp in miral Bosnia and I will update down some contect his relative.

And his brother asim warraich 00306945625978 and his buddyâs sheraz ali Facebook Iâd and one man who is living in miral camp is dilawar warraich 0038766237353"

Marijana's comment: "I have got in contact with person who posted this and offered him help in  submitting file to police and embassy about missing boy, but he was reluctant. No official or media report was connected to this case\"""" ;
    frontlet:hasName "Tayyab Warraich" .

